{%- comment -%}
  Furgenics — discount-banner snippet
  Renders the active general discount campaign for the current market.
  ONE source of truth for the active discount code + percentage — when the
  campaign rotates (FUR50 → FUR20 → SUMMER25 → etc.), the change happens in
  theme settings and propagates to every page using this snippet.

  Reads from theme settings (Markets-aware — Shopify Markets allows per-market
  setting values when the theme is configured for that):
    settings.discount_active        (boolean)  Master switch. False = render nothing everywhere.
    settings.discount_code          (string)   e.g. 'FUR50'
    settings.discount_percent       (number)   e.g. 50
    settings.discount_max_units     (number)   e.g. 4 (max gallons per order); optional
    settings.discount_eligibility   (string)   e.g. 'New customers, first order only'; optional
    settings.discount_headline      (string)   Optional headline override (e.g. 'Spring sale')

  Per-call overrides — any parameter passed beats the setting:
    {% render 'discount-banner' %}
    {% render 'discount-banner', code: 'GROOMER25', percent: 25, eligibility: 'Verified groomers only' %}
    {% render 'discount-banner', active: false %}   (hide on this specific page)

  Returns nothing if discount is inactive OR if code/percent are missing.

  Used internally by sections/main-page-pillar.liquid for [[DISCOUNT]] token
  substitution. Can also be called directly from theme templates / sections
  if needed elsewhere.

  Maintenance: when a campaign rotates, edit ONE place:
    Shopify admin → Online Store → Themes → Customize → Theme settings →
    "Active discount campaign" section → update code + percent → save.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign _active = active -%}
{%- if _active == nil -%}
  {%- assign _active = settings.discount_active -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if _active == false -%}
  {%- comment -%}Campaign off — render nothing.{%- endcomment -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign _code = code | default: settings.discount_code -%}
  {%- assign _percent = percent | default: settings.discount_percent -%}
  {%- assign _max_units = max_units | default: settings.discount_max_units -%}
  {%- assign _eligibility = eligibility | default: settings.discount_eligibility -%}
  {%- assign _headline = headline | default: settings.discount_headline -%}

  {%- if _code != blank and _percent != blank -%}
    <div class="discount-banner" data-code="{{ _code | escape }}" data-percent="{{ _percent }}">
      {% if _headline != blank %}<strong class="discount-banner-headline">{{ _headline }}</strong> {% endif %}<strong>Save {{ _percent }}% on your first order</strong> with code <code class="discount-banner-code">{{ _code }}</code>.{% if _max_units %} Max {{ _max_units }} gallons per order.{% endif %}{% if _eligibility != blank %} {{ _eligibility }}.{% endif %}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
